于外层 if，应该怎样安排两个块？","result":"将内层 if 整体包入外层真分支的大括号，再在外层右大括号后写 else。"},{"id":"java.example.fdad92f206c09c43c894","lessonId":"java.lesson.fdad92f206c09c43c894","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"若只有 valid 为真才检查 paid，而 valid=false、paid=true，会进入允许路径吗？","result":"不会。外层拒绝后不测试内层，已付款标志无法覆盖无效状态。"}],"activities":[{"id":"java.check.a33b98d20d3271b75bd2","lessonId":"java.lesson.a33b98d20d3271b75bd2","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.a33b98d20d3271b75bd2","prompt":"当 stock=0 时，if (stock>0) { stock=stock-1; } 后 stock 为多少？","reveal":"仍为 0。条件为 false，块内赋值没有执行。"},{"id":"java.check.c06f075326b2dcbec3d4","lessonId":"java.lesson.c06f075326b2dcbec3d4","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.c06f075326b2dcbec3d4","prompt":"if (low) { lamp=1; } else { lamp=2; } 后又写 lamp=3;，最终是什么？","reveal":"最终为 3。最后一条在整个条件语句之后，覆盖分支赋值。"},{"id":"java.practice.credit-branch","lessonId":"java.lesson.ae90476760b51e275270","kind":"rust-judge","profileRef":{"id":"java.practice.credit-branch","version":"1.0.0"},"title":"实例","task":"读一个 int。负数打印欠缺，其余打印够用。用 if 和 else 各表达一种结果。","observation":"唯一输出位于依赖输入的 if 或 else 实际分支内，两种路径均覆盖。","hints":["先写 balance < 0 的路径，再写 else。","检查 -1 和 0，确保恰好跨过边界且每次只打印一行。"],"caseCount":4},{"id":"java.check.f5c602d66636db73d2e1","lessonId":"java.lesson.f5c602d66636db73d2e1","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.f5c602d66636db73d2e1","prompt":"先判断 n>=0，再在 else if 判断 n>=10，n=15 会走第二个分支吗？","reveal":"不会。n>=0 已成立，第二个条件不再被求值。"},{"id":"java.check.ca699c7b57c8de919bf9","lessonId":"java.lesson.ca699c7b57c8de919bf9","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.ca699c7b57c8de919bf9","prompt":"x=-1、0、1 依次属于哪三条路径？","reveal":"分别走首个条件、第二个条件和 else，恰好覆盖零两侧。"},{"id":"java.check.30ea6b2d72870614a5ed","lessonId":"java.lesson.30ea6b2d72870614a5ed","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.30ea6b2d72870614a5ed","prompt":"要让 else 属于外层 if，应该怎样安排两个块？","reveal":"将内层 if 整体包入外层真分支的大括号，再在外层右大括号后写 else。"},{"id":"java.check.fd